<view class="page"><view class="title">{{id?'衣物详情':'放进衣柜'}}</view><view class="muted">选择照片 → 核对信息 → 保存</view><button disabled="{{busy || pending}}" bindtap="choose">{{draft.image?'更换照片':'拍照或从相册选择'}}</button><image wx:if="{{photo}}" src="{{photo}}" mode="aspectFit" class="preview"/><view class="card"><input class="field" placeholder="衣物名称" value="{{draft.name}}" data-key="name" bindinput="field" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><picker range="{{categories}}" range-key="label" value="{{categoryIndex}}" bindchange="category" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"><view class="field">{{categoryIndex>=0?categories[categoryIndex].label:'请选择衣物分类（必填）'}} ▾</view></picker><input class="field" placeholder="颜色，用顿号分隔，例如 米色、棕色" value="{{color}}" bindinput="color" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><button class="secondary" disabled="{{busy || pending}}" bindtap="favorite">{{draft.favorite?'♥ 已收藏':'♡ 收藏这件'}}</button></view><view wx:if="{{draft.image}}" class="card"><view class="section">衣物图片工坊</view><view class="muted">分割按分类去除背景；失败请换清晰照片。卡通生成需先在设置配置生图 API，可能产生费用。已有分割图时优先用分割图生图。</view><button class="secondary" data-kind="extract" disabled="{{busy || pending || !draft.category}}" bindtap="process">分割去背景</button><button data-kind="cartoon" disabled="{{busy || pending || !draft.category}}" bindtap="process">转成卡通风格</button><view class="row"><button class="small" data-mode="original" disabled="{{busy || pending}}" bindtap="mode">原图</button><button class="small" data-mode="cutout" disabled="{{busy || pending || !draft.cutoutImage}}" bindtap="mode">{{draft.imageMode==='cutout'?'✓ ':''}}分割图</button><button class="small" data-mode="cartoon" disabled="{{busy || pending || !draft.cartoonImage}}" bindtap="mode">{{draft.imageMode==='cartoon'?'✓ ':''}}卡通图</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{pending}}" class="card"><view class="section">核对处理结果</view><image src="{{preview}}" mode="aspectFit" class="preview"/><view class="muted">{{pending.notice}}</view><button bindtap="accept">采用这张图</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="reject">不采用</button></view><view wx:if="{{status}}" class="muted">{{status}}</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}。信息已保留，可重试。</view><button disabled="{{busy || pending}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="save">保存到衣柜</button><button wx:if="{{id}}" class="secondary" disabled="{{busy || pending}}" bindtap="remove">删除衣物</button></view>